OL,3,GNEWSAMan seriously injured after being
OL,4,Ahit by lorry
OL,5,
OL,6,FA man has been seriously injured after
OL,7,Fbeing hit by a lorry in Nottingham.
OL,9,FOfficers were called to Bulwell Lane,
OL,10,Fin Old Basford, at about 09:00 BST on
OL,11,FWednesday following reports of a
OL,12,Fcollision between a lorry and a
OL,13,Fpedestrian.
OL,15,FNottinghamshire Police said emergency
OL,16,Fservices are currently at the scene and
OL,17,Furged people to avoid the area while an
OL,18,Finvestigation takes place.
OL,23,APub: 02-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
